title HUNK12 — the non-destructive edit-list is content-addressed; reproduce from cold
prompt Continue the autonomous loop: keep taking agent-doable laps Lindy-first crux-first, send each finished increment as its own signed round, stop at custody gates.
think HUNK11 landed and shipped the edit-list (verbs as data, deterministic replay). Its design doc named HUNK12 as the next crux: bead an edit-list into Tablecloth so (image, edit-list address) reproduces the edited image from cold. That is the higher-Lindy continuation — it banks HUNK11's determinism as a content-address guarantee.
think Studied the HUNK6 sprite_store and HUNK1 image_artifact pattern: tablecloth.store_artifact / fetch_artifact is a generic verified byte store (digest-checked before return). An edit-list's format photo-edits-v1 text is just a byte stream, so I mirrored the store/fetch/verify shape exactly.
think Built pond/apps/edit_store.rye: store_edits renders the list to text and beads it content-addressed (bounded to a resin, refusing EditsTooLarge); open_edits fetches verified then parses; reproduce fetches verified then applies over a source image — so a tampered recipe or unknown name refuses before any verb replays. Symlinked photo_edits.rye into pond/apps beside the existing qoi/photos/parse_int/tally_copy links.
obs GREEN on the first build and run: the cold reproduction equals a direct apply byte-for-byte (edited pixels never stored, only the 58-byte recipe), the recipe dedup dividend holds (same list two names, stored once, 1/1 beads deduped), a tampered recipe refuses DigestMismatch and an unknown name refuses UnknownArtifact each before a verb runs.
obs One witness grep pattern was wrong (a `.*` expected a token between "same" and "recipe" where the text is adjacent) — fixed to the literal text; the code itself was GREEN throughout. tame_style_check bans clean, width exit 0.
loom witness=hunk_edit_store_witness green=1 recipe_bytes=58 verbs=3 beads_deduped=1
file pond/apps/edit_store.rye HUNK12 — store_edits, open_edits, reproduce; GREEN selftest.
file pond/apps/photo_edits.rye symlink to image/photo_edits.rye so pond/apps composes it.
